@name     wave_findloop
@alias    /findloop
@group    wave
@c_name   skode_clause_wave_findloop_slash_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  detect loop points for active voice wavetable slot
@doc
Analyzes wavetable slot, detects seamless sustain loop points via autocorrelation, applies them, and returns metadata string.
Usage: /findloop
@code
    return skode_exec_wave_findloop(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

@name     wave_findloop
